# webcam_sim.jgs -- webcamlist, webcam, snapshot, preview and closePreview on
# jgraph.internal.camsim's cameras (device classes plan, stage D11, ADR 0195). JGraph-only: R2025b on
# the recording machine has no USB Webcams support package, and a real camera's frames are not
# reproducible, so expected/webcam_sim.txt is written from the rule. The cases are MATLAB code in
# helpers/webcam_sim_case.m.

